{
  "name": "Stage 01 - Topic Research, Idea Bank & Scoring (Demo)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111201",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1800, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stage 2 demo workflow\nThis workflow is a SAFE, NON-FUNCTIONAL demonstration of\nthe 7-dimension scoring model and blocking rule defined in\ndocs/07-topic-scoring-methodology.md. It uses only\nfictitious sample data, calls no external services, and\nrequires no credentials.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111202",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1820, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "f1", "name": "topic_id", "type": "string", "value": "TOPIC-DEMO-0001" },
            { "id": "f2", "name": "working_title", "type": "string", "value": "[EXAMPLE] Why does this European microstate still exist?" },
            { "id": "f3", "name": "category", "type": "string", "value": "curiosities" },
            { "id": "f4", "name": "region", "type": "string", "value": "Europe" },
            { "id": "f5", "name": "demand_score", "type": "string", "value": "NOT_MEASURED" },
            { "id": "f6", "name": "competition_score", "type": "string", "value": "NOT_MEASURED" },
            { "id": "f7", "name": "evergreen_score", "type": "number", "value": 9 },
            { "id": "f8", "name": "source_availability_score", "type": "number", "value": 9 },
            { "id": "f9", "name": "visual_rights_availability_score", "type": "number", "value": 8 },
            { "id": "f10", "name": "production_ease_score", "type": "number", "value": 7 },
            { "id": "f11", "name": "monetization_safety_score", "type": "number", "value": 8 },
            { "id": "f12", "name": "sources_available_status", "type": "string", "value": "REQUIRES_MANUAL_REVIEW" },
            { "id": "f13", "name": "visual_resources_feasible_status", "type": "string", "value": "REQUIRES_MANUAL_REVIEW" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111203",
      "name": "Set Fictitious Topic Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-1580, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1) Idea bank intake\nManual Trigger simulates a new topic idea being\nlogged. Fields mirror templates/topic-registry.csv +\ntemplates/topic-scoring-log.csv. demand_score and\ncompetition_score are NOT_MEASURED by default - the\nworkflow never invents them. Edit fields to test\neach branch below.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111204",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Idea Bank",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1600, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "c1", "leftValue": "={{$json.topic_id}}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" } },
            { "id": "c2", "leftValue": "={{$json.working_title}}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" } },
            { "id": "c3", "leftValue": "={{$json.category}}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111205",
      "name": "Validate Required Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-1340, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "e1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "BLOCKED_INVALID_INTAKE" },
            { "id": "e2", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "One or more required topic fields are missing." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111206",
      "name": "Blocked - Invalid Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-1100, 640]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "s1", "leftValue": "={{$json.sources_available_status}}", "rightValue": "INSUFFICIENT", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEquals" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111207",
      "name": "Sources Sufficient?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-1100, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2) Hard blocking gates\nPer docs/07-topic-scoring-methodology.md, a topic is\nblocked immediately if sources_available_status or\nvisual_resources_feasible_status = INSUFFICIENT -\nregardless of how high its score would be. This runs\nBEFORE scoring, not after.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111208",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Blocking Gates",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1120, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "r1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "BLOCKED_NO_SOURCES" },
            { "id": "r2", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "sources_available_status = INSUFFICIENT." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111209",
      "name": "Blocked - No Sources",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-860, 640]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "v1", "leftValue": "={{$json.visual_resources_feasible_status}}", "rightValue": "INSUFFICIENT", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEquals" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111210",
      "name": "Visual Rights Sufficient?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-860, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "w1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "BLOCKED_NO_VISUAL_RIGHTS" },
            { "id": "w2", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "visual_resources_feasible_status = INSUFFICIENT." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111211",
      "name": "Blocked - No Visual Rights",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-620, 640]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "sc1",
              "name": "final_score",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ (() => { const dims = ['demand_score','competition_score','evergreen_score','source_availability_score','visual_rights_availability_score','production_ease_score','monetization_safety_score']; const nums = dims.map(d => $json[d]).filter(v => typeof v === 'number'); if (nums.length < 4) { return 'REQUIRES_MANUAL_REVIEW'; } return String(Math.round((nums.reduce((a,b) => a+b, 0) / nums.length) * 10) / 10); })() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "sc2",
              "name": "measured_dimension_count",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ ['demand_score','competition_score','evergreen_score','source_availability_score','visual_rights_availability_score','production_ease_score','monetization_safety_score'].map(d => $json[d]).filter(v => typeof v === 'number').length }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111212",
      "name": "Compute Final Score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-620, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3) Scoring formula\nfinal_score = mean of whichever of the 7 dimensions\nare real numbers (NOT_MEASURED entries are excluded,\nnever guessed). If fewer than 4 of 7 are measured,\nfinal_score = 'REQUIRES_MANUAL_REVIEW' instead of a\nnumber - see docs/07-topic-scoring-methodology.md.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111213",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Formula",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-640, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "rec1", "leftValue": "={{$json.final_score}}", "rightValue": "REQUIRES_MANUAL_REVIEW", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEquals" } },
            { "id": "rec2", "leftValue": "={{$json.final_score}}", "rightValue": 6, "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gte" } },
            { "id": "rec3", "leftValue": "={{$json.sources_available_status}}", "rightValue": "CONFIRMED", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } },
            { "id": "rec4", "leftValue": "={{$json.visual_resources_feasible_status}}", "rightValue": "CONFIRMED", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111214",
      "name": "final_score >= 6.0 AND both gates CONFIRMED?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-380, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "p1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW" },
            { "id": "p2", "name": "recommended", "type": "boolean", "value": false },
            { "id": "p3", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "Scored, but final_score < 6.0, not yet computable, or gates not both CONFIRMED by a human reviewer." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111215",
      "name": "Pending - Human Review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-120, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "a1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "SOURCES_VERIFIED" },
            { "id": "a2", "name": "recommended", "type": "boolean", "value": true }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111216",
      "name": "Approved - SOURCES_VERIFIED",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-120, 140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4) Outcomes\nOnly the top path reaches SOURCES_VERIFIED /\nrecommended=true - and only once a HUMAN has set both\ngate fields to CONFIRMED (this workflow's demo data\nnever does that itself). Every other path ends in\nPENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW, BLOCKED_NO_SOURCES,\nBLOCKED_NO_VISUAL_RIGHTS, or BLOCKED_INVALID_INTAKE.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 340
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111217",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Outcomes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-140, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "s1", "name": "execution_summary", "type": "string", "value": "={{ 'topic_id=' + $json.topic_id + ' | status=' + $json.status + ' | final_score=' + ($json.final_score || 'n/a') + ' | recommended=' + $json.recommended + ' | reason=' + ($json.block_reason || 'n/a') }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111218",
      "name": "Execution Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [160, 300]
    }
  ],
